stateDiagram-v2
    accTitle: buildLesson job lifecycle
    accDescr: A lesson job moves through six running stages under one lease. Rejection is final; model, storage and adapter failures retry within three attempts and a one-hour attempt deadline.
    [*] --> queued: POST lessons admitted in one transaction
    queued --> running: GPU runner claims, needs lesson adapter and Gemini key
    state running {
        [*] --> downloadingInput
        downloadingInput --> screeningVideo
        screeningVideo --> generatingBodies: moves found
        generatingBodies --> writingLesson: analysis.json ready
        writingLesson --> checkingLesson: lesson.json written
        checkingLesson --> publishingAssets: bundle passes app contract
    }
    running --> succeeded: publish_lesson creates lessons doc and sets latestLessonId
    running --> failed: lesson_rejected, nothing to teach
    running --> failed: lesson_unavailable, video and analysis clocks disagree
    running --> retrying: lesson_unavailable, model_unavailable or reconstruction_failed
    retrying --> running: next attempt reuses cached model answers
    retrying --> failed: attempts or 24 h deadline exhausted
    queued --> cancelled: project deletion
    running --> cancelled: project deletion
    succeeded --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
